{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106099","id":2499410006,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6U-fhW","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106099","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106099.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106099.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106099","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106099/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106099/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106099/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c9b38969114fa4e2aa9c987c02729708c84cba3e","number":106099,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix editing resources in the inspector when inside an array or dictionary","user":{"login":"xefensor","id":72282274,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjgyMjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72282274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor","html_url":"https://github.com/xefensor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xefensor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #91473 - First PR (first time using C++)\r\n\r\nFixes Inspector not opening Resource from inside Array or Dictionary when\r\nclicking \"Edit\", by properly signaling `resource_selected`.\r\n\r\nWhen clicking \"Edit\" on a Resource in the Inspector, the `resource_selected`\r\nsignal is emitted. This works correctly when the Resource is a standalone\r\nexported property, and the signal reaches `EditorInspector::_resource_selected`.\r\n\r\nHowever, when the Resource is stored inside an Array or Dictionary, the signal\r\nwas not reaching the EditorInspector, because it was blocked by the container\r\nproperty (Array/Dictionary) in between.\r\n\r\nThis fix forwards the `resource_selected` signal from the nested Resource\r\nthrough the container (Array or Dictionary), up to the Inspector, allowing it\r\nto display the selected Resource as expected.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gi